Magic Hour has no credits available, so I can’t render an MP4. The closest I can provide here is **one self-contained HTML film**: a 30-second illustrated animation with consistent characters, matching title cards, synthesized rain, and browser-generated dialogue.

Save the code below as **`Walk Anyway.html`**, open it in a browser, and click **Play**. It needs no images or external libraries. The spoken voice depends on your browser’s available voices.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Walk Anyway</title>
